---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy policy" description="How TheCasinos.com collects, uses and protects visitor information." cacheSeconds={86400}>
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p>Last reviewed for the new platform: August 2026.</p></div></section>
  <article class="section container legal-copy">
    <p>This policy explains how TheCasinos.com handles information when you access and use the service.</p>
    <h2>Definitions</h2><ul><li><strong>Company</strong>: TheCasinos.com.</li><li><strong>Personal data</strong>: information relating to an identifiable person.</li><li><strong>Usage data</strong>: technical information generated when the service is used.</li><li><strong>Service provider</strong>: a third party helping us operate or analyse the service.</li></ul>
    <h2>Data we collect</h2><p>The public directory can be browsed without an account. We may receive standard technical data such as IP address, browser type, requested pages, timestamps and diagnostic events through hosting and security infrastructure. If you contact us, we receive the information you choose to send.</p>
    <h2>Administration accounts</h2><p>Authorised editors use Supabase Authentication. Account identifiers and authentication events are processed to secure access. Administrative actions may be recorded in an audit log.</p>
    <h2>How data is used</h2><ul><li>Operate, secure and monitor the website.</li><li>Respond to feedback and correction requests.</li><li>Diagnose errors and improve performance.</li><li>Prevent abuse and unauthorised access.</li></ul>
    <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2><p>The public site does not require advertising cookies. Essential browser storage may be used to maintain an authenticated administration session. If analytics or non-essential cookies are introduced, this policy and the relevant consent mechanism must be updated first.</p>
    <h2>Service providers</h2><p>Netlify provides hosting and delivery infrastructure, while Supabase provides database and authentication services. Map tiles may be requested from the map provider when the interactive map is opened. Those providers process data under their respective terms and privacy notices.</p>
    <h2>Retention and security</h2><p>Information is retained only as long as necessary for the purpose for which it was collected, legal obligations and security needs. No online service can guarantee absolute security, but access controls, least-privilege policies and encrypted connections are used to reduce risk.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2><p>Depending on applicable law, you may request access, correction, deletion, restriction or portability of your personal data, and object to certain processing.</p>
    <h2>Changes</h2><p>We may update this policy as the service changes. The current version and review date will remain available on this page.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions or rights requests, email <a class="text-link" href="mailto:admin@thecasinos.com">admin@thecasinos.com</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>.page-hero{padding:32px 0 36px;background:var(--forest);color:#fff}.page-hero .eyebrow{color:var(--lime)}.page-hero h1{margin-bottom:10px;font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4.2vw,3.7rem)}.page-hero p:last-child{margin-bottom:0;color:#b8cbc5;font-size:.9rem}@media(max-width:620px){.page-hero{padding:24px 0 28px}}</style>
